---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="股利所得稅 × 二代健保補充保費計算機"
  description="一年領 50 萬股利，真正拿到手的是多少？填入股利與你的所得，算出合併計稅 vs 分開計稅哪個省、每一筆配息會不會被扣 2.11% 補充保費，以及稅加保費吃掉股利的幾成——對應 EP53。"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-brand font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Tools · 對應 EP53</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-3">股利所得稅 × 二代健保補充保費計算機</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        資產到了一千萬的量級，放在殖利率五六趴的高股息 ETF，一年會領到五六十萬股利。這筆錢在進你帳戶之前，會先被扣<strong>二代健保補充保費</strong>，隔年報稅還要再選一次<strong>合併計稅或分開計稅</strong>。
        填入你的股利與所得，看看配息實際拿到手的有幾成。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Inputs -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-8 bg-gray-50/60">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">你的股利與所得</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <label class="block">
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">全年股利所得（NT$）</span>
          <input id="div" type="number" min="0" step="10000" value="500000"
            class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 focus:border-brand focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand outline-none" />
          <span class="block text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">只填可適用 8.5% 抵減的國內股利（扣繳憑單所得類別 54C）。ETF 配息請看投信的收益分配通知，收益平準金、資本利得等不屬於股利所得的部分不要填進來。</span>
        </label>
        <label class="block">
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">其他綜合所得淨額（不含股利，NT$）</span>
          <input id="net" type="number" min="0" step="10000" value="800000"
            class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 focus:border-brand focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand outline-none" />
          <span class="block text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">＝所得總額扣掉免稅額與各項扣除額之後的數字。<button id="helpBtn" type="button" class="text-brand hover:underline">不知道？用年薪估算</button></span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div id="helpBox" class="hidden mt-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3">
          <label class="block">
            <span class="text-gray-600">單身、只有薪資的年薪（NT$）</span>
            <input id="salary" type="number" min="0" step="10000" value="1300000"
              class="mt-1 w-48 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 focus:border-brand focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand outline-none" />
          </label>
          <button id="applySalary" type="button" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand-dark transition-colors">帶入估算淨額</button>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">115 年度單身、只有薪資、用標準扣除額：淨額 ≈ 年薪 − 免稅額 101,000 − 標準扣除額 136,000 − 薪資特別扣除額 227,000（合計 46.4 萬）。有扶養、已婚或列舉扣除的人請以自己的試算為準。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5">
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">股利分幾次入帳</span>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-1" id="freqBtns">
          <button type="button" data-n="1" class="freq px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-sm">年配（1 次）</button>
          <button type="button" data-n="2" class="freq px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-sm">半年配（2 次）</button>
          <button type="button" data-n="4" class="freq px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-sm">季配（4 次）</button>
          <button type="button" data-n="12" class="freq px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-sm">月配（12 次）</button>
          <button type="button" data-n="0" class="freq px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-sm">逐筆輸入</button>
        </div>
        <textarea id="custom" rows="2" placeholder="每一筆股利金額，用逗號或換行分隔，例如：120000, 95000, 18000"
          class="hidden mt-2 w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-brand focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand outline-none"></textarea>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">選年配／季配／月配時，視為全年股利平均分成那幾筆。逐筆輸入時，全年股利以各筆加總為準。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Verdict cards -->
    <div id="cards" class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6"></div>

    <!-- Insight -->
    <div id="insight" class="rounded-2xl border border-brand/30 bg-brand/5 p-5 mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed"></div>

    <!-- Tax compare -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">所得稅：合併計稅 vs 分開計稅</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4">兩種方式每年報稅時擇一，同一申報戶的股利要一起選。下表的「股利造成的稅」＝有股利時的應納稅額 − 沒有股利時的應納稅額。</p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="text-left text-gray-500 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium"></th>
              <th class="py-2 px-4 font-medium text-right">合併計稅</th>
              <th class="py-2 pl-4 font-medium text-right">分開計稅</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="taxBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p id="turning" class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed"></p>
    </div>

    <!-- NHI -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">二代健保補充保費：看的是「單次」</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4">單次給付的股利達 20,000 元就按 2.11% 扣，未達不扣；單次超過 1,000 萬的部分不計。直接從配息裡扣掉，報稅時不會退。</p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="text-left text-gray-500 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">同樣的全年股利，分成</th>
              <th class="py-2 px-4 font-medium text-right">每筆約</th>
              <th class="py-2 px-4 font-medium text-right">被扣的筆數</th>
              <th class="py-2 pl-4 font-medium text-right">補充保費合計</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="nhiBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3">這張表只是讓你看出「單次門檻」這條規則的效果：全年股利夠大的時候，不管分幾次，每一筆都會超過 2 萬，保費一樣；只有每筆落在 2 萬上下的人，配息頻率才會影響保費。挑 ETF 應該看總報酬與費用，不是看它一年配幾次。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Per-payment details -->
    <details class="mb-8">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-brand select-none mb-3">▸ 你的每一筆配息明細</summary>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-3">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="text-left text-gray-500 border-b border-gray-200">
              <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">第幾筆</th>
              <th class="py-2 px-4 font-medium text-right">股利</th>
              <th class="py-2 px-4 font-medium text-right">是否達 2 萬</th>
              <th class="py-2 pl-4 font-medium text-right">補充保費</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="payBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Note -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-8 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">💡 幾個常被搞錯的地方</p>
      <p><strong>合併計稅不一定比較貴：</strong>股利併入綜合所得，但可以拿股利的 8.5% 抵減應納稅額，每一申報戶上限 8 萬元。所得不高的人，8.5% 可能比股利多繳的稅還多，會變成退稅。夫妻合併申報時，8 萬上限是兩個人共用的。</p>
      <p><strong>分開計稅是固定 28%：</strong>股利不併入綜合所得，另外按 28% 算，不能再用 8.5% 抵減。按 115 年度級距逐一驗算，綜合所得淨額加上股利之後如果還在 519 萬以內（最高只到 30% 級距），合併計稅一定比較省；要有一段進到 40% 級距，分開計稅才可能比較划算。</p>
      <p><strong>補充保費和所得稅是兩件事：</strong>選哪種計稅方式都不影響補充保費，它在配息入帳時就已經扣掉了。改成「全年累計、隔年多退少補」的年度結算制曾被研議，目前暫緩、沒有實施，本工具照現行的單次制計算。</p>
      <p><strong>配息不是多出來的錢：</strong>除息那天淨值就先少掉同樣的金額，稅和保費卻是在配出來之後才開始算。為什麼我不拿高股息 ETF 當核心配置，見 <a class="text-brand hover:underline" href="/articles/ep33-high-dividend-etf">EP33</a>；資產到一千萬之後會碰到的其他幾條線，見 <a class="text-brand hover:underline" href="/articles/ep53-ten-million-liquid-wealth">EP53</a>。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Disclaimer + CTA -->
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      本計算機僅供一般資訊參考，採 115 年度綜合所得稅速算公式（財政部公告）與現行二代健保補充保費規定簡化計算，未考慮最低稅負制、其他抵減、特殊投保身分（如雇主、無投保身分者）及免扣費對象等情形。實際稅額以國稅局核定為準，不構成任何投資或稅務建議。
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/articles/ep53-ten-million-liquid-wealth" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand-dark transition-colors">讀 EP53 存到一千萬之後 →</a>
      <a href="/articles/ep33-high-dividend-etf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 text-gray-700 hover:border-brand transition-colors">讀 EP33 高股息 ETF</a>
      <a href="/tools" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 text-gray-700 hover:border-brand transition-colors">看其他工具</a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      // CALC-START
      // 115 年度綜合所得稅速算公式（財政部賦稅署公告）
      const BRACKETS = [
        { upTo: 610000, rate: 0.05, diff: 0 },
        { upTo: 1380000, rate: 0.12, diff: 42700 },
        { upTo: 2770000, rate: 0.20, diff: 153100 },
        { upTo: 5190000, rate: 0.30, diff: 430100 },
        { upTo: Infinity, rate: 0.40, diff: 949100 },
      ];
      const CREDIT_RATE = 0.085, CREDIT_CAP = 80000, SEP_RATE = 0.28;
      const NHI_RATE = 0.0211, NHI_MIN = 20000, NHI_MAX = 10000000;

      function bracketTax(net) {
        if (net <= 0) return 0;
        const b = BRACKETS.find(x => net <= x.upTo);
        return Math.round(net * b.rate - b.diff);
      }
      function marginalRate(net) {
        if (net <= 0) return 0.05;
        return BRACKETS.find(x => net <= x.upTo).rate;
      }
      // 合併計稅：股利併入淨額，減 8.5% 可抵減稅額（上限 8 萬），可為負（退稅）
      function combinedTax(net, div) {
        return bracketTax(net + div) - Math.min(Math.round(div * CREDIT_RATE), CREDIT_CAP);
      }
      // 分開計稅：其他所得照累進，股利 28%
      function separateTax(net, div) {
        return bracketTax(net) + Math.round(div * SEP_RATE);
      }
      function nhiOne(amount) {
        if (amount < NHI_MIN) return 0;
        return Math.round(Math.min(amount, NHI_MAX) * NHI_RATE);
      }
      function nhiTotal(payments) {
        return payments.reduce((s, a) => s + nhiOne(a), 0);
      }
      function splitEven(total, n) {
        const each = Math.floor(total / n);
        const arr = Array(n).fill(each);
        arr[0] += total - each * n;
        return arr;
      }
      // 給定股利，其他淨額從 0 往上掃，找分開計稅開始比較省的最小淨額（找不到回傳 null）
      function turningNet(div) {
        if (div <= 0) return null;
        for (let net = 0; net <= 20000000; net += 10000) {
          if (separateTax(net, div) < combinedTax(net, div)) return net;
        }
        return null;
      }
      // CALC-END

      const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
      const num = (id) => Math.max(0, parseFloat($(id).value) || 0);
      const wan = (n) => (n / 10000).toLocaleString('en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 1 }) + ' 萬';
      const ntd = (n) => (n < 0 ? '−' : '') + 'NT$' + Math.abs(Math.round(n)).toLocaleString('en-US');
      const pct = (x) => (x * 100).toFixed(1) + '%';
      let freq = 4;

      function paymentsNow() {
        if (freq === 0) {
          return $('custom').value.split(/[,，\s]+/).map(s => parseFloat(s.replace(/[^\d.]/g, ''))).filter(x => x > 0);
        }
        return splitEven(Math.round(num('div')), freq);
      }

      function render() {
        document.querySelectorAll('.freq').forEach(b => {
          const on = parseInt(b.dataset.n) === freq;
          b.className = 'freq px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-sm ' + (on ? 'border-brand bg-brand text-white' : 'border-gray-300 text-gray-700 hover:border-brand');
        });
        $('custom').classList.toggle('hidden', freq !== 0);
        $('div').disabled = freq === 0;

        const pays = paymentsNow();
        const div = freq === 0 ? pays.reduce((s, a) => s + a, 0) : Math.round(num('div'));
        if (freq === 0) $('div').value = Math.round(div);
        const net = Math.round(num('net'));

        const base = bracketTax(net);
        const comb = combinedTax(net, div), sep = separateTax(net, div);
        const combInc = comb - base, sepInc = sep - base;
        const best = Math.min(combInc, sepInc);
        const bestName = combInc <= sepInc ? '合併計稅' : '分開計稅';
        const nhi = nhiTotal(pays);
        const cost = best + nhi;
        const keep = div ? (div - cost) / div : 1;

        $('cards').innerHTML = `
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-brand bg-brand/5 p-5">
            <div class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 mb-1">實際拿到手</div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">${div ? pct(keep) : '—'}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">${ntd(div - cost)}（股利 ${ntd(div)}）</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-5">
            <div class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 mb-1">股利造成的所得稅（${bestName}）</div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">${ntd(best)}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">${best < 0 ? '負數＝8.5% 抵減比多繳的稅還多，會退稅' : '佔股利 ' + (div ? pct(best / div) : '—')}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-5">
            <div class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 mb-1">二代健保補充保費</div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold" style="color:#C5611A">${ntd(nhi)}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">${pays.filter(a => a >= NHI_MIN).length} / ${pays.length} 筆達 2 萬門檻</div>
          </div>`;

        const diff = Math.abs(combInc - sepInc);
        $('insight').innerHTML = `
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">📌 怎麼讀這個結果</p>
          <p class="mb-2">其他所得淨額 ${wan(net)}（邊際稅率 ${Math.round(marginalRate(net) * 100)}%），一年股利 ${wan(div)}：選<strong>${bestName}</strong>比較省，兩者差 <strong>${ntd(diff)}</strong>。</p>
          <p>稅加上補充保費，這筆股利大約有 <strong style="color:#C5611A">${div ? pct(cost / div) : '—'}</strong> ${cost >= 0 ? '在進到你口袋之前就先付掉了' : '——這個所得水準下，8.5% 抵減反而讓你整體多拿回一點'}。殖利率 5% 的配息，實際到手的報酬率約是 ${div ? (5 * keep).toFixed(2) + '%' : '—'}。</p>`;

        $('taxBody').innerHTML = `
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-gray-500">含股利的應納稅額</td><td class="py-2 px-4 text-right">${ntd(comb)}</td><td class="py-2 pl-4 text-right">${ntd(sep)}</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-gray-500">不含股利的應納稅額</td><td class="py-2 px-4 text-right">${ntd(base)}</td><td class="py-2 pl-4 text-right">${ntd(base)}</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 font-medium"><td class="py-2 pr-4">股利造成的稅</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-4 text-right" style="${combInc <= sepInc ? 'color:#C5611A' : ''}">${ntd(combInc)}</td>
            <td class="py-2 pl-4 text-right" style="${sepInc < combInc ? 'color:#C5611A' : ''}">${ntd(sepInc)}</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-gray-500">佔股利</td><td class="py-2 px-4 text-right text-gray-500">${div ? pct(combInc / div) : '—'}</td><td class="py-2 pl-4 text-right text-gray-500">${div ? pct(sepInc / div) : '—'}</td></tr>`;

        const t = turningNet(div);
        $('turning').innerHTML = t === null
          ? '在這個股利金額下，合併計稅一直比較省。'
          : `轉折點：一年股利 ${wan(div)} 的話，<strong>其他所得淨額大約 ${wan(t)} 以上</strong>，分開計稅才開始比較省，也就是加上股利之後的淨額有一段進到 40% 級距。股利越大，8.5% 抵減越早碰到 8 萬上限，這條線會越往下移。`;

        const rows = [[1, '年配 1 次'], [2, '半年配 2 次'], [4, '季配 4 次'], [12, '月配 12 次']].map(([n, label]) => {
          const p = splitEven(div, n);
          const hit = p.filter(a => a >= NHI_MIN).length;
          return `<tr class="border-b border-gray-100${n === freq ? ' font-medium' : ''}">
            <td class="py-2 pr-4">${label}${n === freq ? '（你目前的選擇）' : ''}</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-4 text-right text-gray-500">${ntd(div / n)}</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-4 text-right text-gray-500">${hit} / ${n}</td>
            <td class="py-2 pl-4 text-right" style="color:#C5611A">${ntd(nhiTotal(p))}</td></tr>`;
        });
        $('nhiBody').innerHTML = rows.join('');

        $('payBody').innerHTML = pays.length ? pays.map((a, i) => `<tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="py-2 pr-4">第 ${i + 1} 筆</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-4 text-right">${ntd(a)}</td>
            <td class="py-2 px-4 text-right text-gray-500">${a >= NHI_MIN ? '是' : '否'}</td>
            <td class="py-2 pl-4 text-right" style="color:#C5611A">${ntd(nhiOne(a))}</td></tr>`).join('')
          : '<tr><td class="py-2 text-gray-400" colspan="4">還沒有輸入任何一筆</td></tr>';
      }

      document.querySelectorAll('.freq').forEach(b => b.addEventListener('click', () => { freq = parseInt(b.dataset.n); render(); }));
      ['div', 'net', 'custom'].forEach(id => $(id).addEventListener('input', render));
      $('helpBtn').addEventListener('click', () => $('helpBox').classList.toggle('hidden'));
      $('applySalary').addEventListener('click', () => {
        $('net').value = Math.max(0, Math.round(num('salary')) - 464000);
        render();
      });
      render();
    })();
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
